Package: bibnets
Title: Importing, Constructing, and Exporting Bibliometric Networks
Version: 0.4.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Mohammed", "Saqr", , "saqr@saqr.me", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-5881-3109")),
    person("Sonsoles", "López-Pernas", role = "aut",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-9621-1392")))
Description: Constructs bibliometric networks from scholarly data. Supports
    co-authorship, keyword co-occurrence, co-citation, bibliographic
    coupling, and direct citation networks with multiple counting and
    normalisation methods. Reads 'Scopus', 'Web of Science', 'BibTeX',
    'RIS', 'OpenAlex', 'Lens.org', and 'Dimensions' exports. Includes
    tools for temporal analysis, backbone extraction, and export to
    common network formats.
